{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "bch-staff-lms-module",
    "name": "BCH OPS — Staff LMS / Learning Module",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Comprehensive Postman collection for all Staff LMS / Learning module endpoints.\n\n## Authentication Strategies\n\n### 1. Mobile App Bearer Auth (Recommended for App Integration)\n- Call **00 Auth & Mobile Login → 1. Mobile Login (accessCode)** with `accessCode` (e.g. `BCH-ADM-01` or `BCH-MECH-01`).\n- The test script automatically saves the returned JWT `token` into collection variables.\n- All subsequent requests attach `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}`.\n\n### 2. Web NextAuth Cookie Session\n- Run **00 Auth & Mobile Login → 2. Web CSRF Token** followed by **3. Web Sign in (accessCode)**.\n- NextAuth session cookie (`next-auth.session-token`) is saved and attached automatically."
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "accessCode",
      "value": "BCH-ADM-01",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "csrfToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "courseId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "lessonId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "quizId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "weeklyTestId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "productId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "levelId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "playbookId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 Auth & Mobile Login",
      "description": "Endpoints to authenticate mobile app and web clients.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Mobile Login (accessCode)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (j.token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', j.token);",
                  "  pm.test('Mobile token captured', () => pm.expect(j.token).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"accessCode\": \"{{accessCode}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/mobile-login",
            "description": "Mobile app login with accessCode. Returns JWT token and user permissions."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Web CSRF Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('csrfToken', j.csrfToken);",
                  "pm.test('csrfToken captured', () => pm.expect(j.csrfToken).to.be.a('string'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/csrf",
            "description": "Captures CSRF token for NextAuth web cookie login."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Web Sign in (accessCode)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                {
                  "key": "csrfToken",
                  "value": "{{csrfToken}}",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "key": "accessCode",
                  "value": "{{accessCode}}",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "key": "json",
                  "value": "true",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/callback/credentials",
            "description": "NextAuth web credential sign in."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4. Verify Session & Permissions",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/session",
            "description": "Verifies active session and roles."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
